<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4470" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλοι-όω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλοῖος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>change,
			alter</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Praec.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφὴν ἐς</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γάλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Gland.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				381a
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>represent as</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλοῖος</span> (q. v.), <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				3.6.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ωθήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					8.6
				</span></i>
			, etc., but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώσομαι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				10.1
			</span></i>:—<i>become different, be changed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλοιοῦσθαι τὴν γνώμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.59
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ ὄψει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					9.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλοίωσιν ἀλλοιοῦσθαι</span>
			<i>undergo an alteration</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				181d
			</span></i>; rare in Poetry, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄλοιντ᾽ ἰδοῦσαι τούσδ᾽ ἂν
					ἠλλοιωμένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					944
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be estranged</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				37.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>to be changed for the worse</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.3.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euphro
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>La.</u>
				4.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>to be confused in mind</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τῆς μέθης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					8.27.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>disguise oneself</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				14.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
